  "mutations": [
    {
      "description": "Remove the profile-governed authorization-registry root check. Mallory has a valid signature for a coherent forged registry; the control must reject before artifact acquisition.",
      "killed_by": "tests/integration/test_isolated_economic_command_authentication_v2.py::test_mallory_signature_cannot_substitute_an_ungoverned_alice_authorization",
      "mutant": {
        "path": "src/core/economic_command_authentication_v2.py",
        "needle_lines": [
          "    if binding.policy_root != candidate.authorization_registry.registry_root:",
          "        raise ValueError(\"command authorization registry is not profile governed\")"
        ],
        "replacement_lines": [
          "    pass"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Remove the selected release message-schema check. A release for a foreign signing contract must remain ineligible.",
      "killed_by": "tests/core/test_economic_command_authentication_v2.py::test_prepare_requires_the_selected_release_to_bind_the_v2_message_schema",
      "mutant": {
        "path": "src/core/economic_command_authentication_v2.py",
        "needle_lines": [
          "    if release.message_schema_root != ECONOMIC_COMMAND_AUTHENTICATION_MESSAGE_SCHEMA_ROOT_V2:",
          "        raise ValueError(\"command signature verifier message schema root mismatch\")"
        ],
        "replacement_lines": [
          "    pass"
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "description": "Ignore the cryptographic result after signature verification. A foreign-key signature must never produce successful authentication.",
      "killed_by": "tests/integration/test_isolated_economic_command_authentication_v2.py::test_signature_for_another_key_or_message_never_authenticates[foreign_key]",
      "mutant": {
        "path": "src/integration/economic_command_authentication_v2.py",
        "needle_lines": [
          "    if verified is not True:",
          "        raise ValueError(\"command authentication signature rejected\")"
        ],
        "replacement_lines": [
          "    return None"
        ]
      }
    }
  ],
  "nonclaims": [
    "The hygiene runner executes the declared Python nodes only. Its protocol fixture intercepts process execution after sealed-file acquisition; no native ELF execution is attributed to that fixture.",
    "The separately configured native test requires ZENODEX_BLS_VERIFIER_TEST_BINARY and SHA-256 597f1e56fcca8f00bc94805cf020ca0e6f2779ded3b1944d1d699231f55b0eee. Default Python runs explicitly skip it; hosted CI execution is not asserted.",
    "Profile/status and release evidence selection remain external premises. Profile status is excluded from the content ID, so matching roots alone cannot establish activation.",
    "Exact measured executable bytes do not prove honest verification in a compromised process, operating system, dynamic loader or library environment.",
    "Signing hashes bounded opaque command bytes. The actual V2 transition must decode or construct its exact command and recompute its origin-bearing body hash.",
    "The actual V2 custody guest, complete settlement profile, replay/current predecessor, durable publication, effects, historical migration and no-bypass remain open.",
    "The mutation ledger must execute these rows against an archived committed subject; packet validation alone is not a mutation result.",
